{"4867340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "All Hands", "steam_appid": 4867340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4941780, 4941790], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867340/extras/7b945f086f047583c9cc6301570eff1a.poster.avif?t=1787615500\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867340/extras/7b945f086f047583c9cc6301570eff1a.webm?t=1787615500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867340/extras/7b945f086f047583c9cc6301570eff1a.mp4?t=1787615500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Meridian Wellness Group:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s All Hands on deck as hundreds of thousands of unsatisfied customers make their way to any and every one of our regional branches! Showcase your capabilities by taking on new appointments and bring these at risk branches back in line with corporate values.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867340/extras/fca55db21a114393682b09908aafe99f.poster.avif?t=1787615500\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867340/extras/fca55db21a114393682b09908aafe99f.webm?t=1787615500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867340/extras/fca55db21a114393682b09908aafe99f.mp4?t=1787615500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Invest in Urban redevelopment:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver on redevelopment projects at our regional centres to best serve the local customer base. Here at the Meridian Wellness Group we are commitment to investing in regional jobs and stimulating the local economy through large scale redevelopment initiatives.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867340/extras/b3a18d3f22288c5769cc0e70406972a2.poster.avif?t=1787615500\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867340/extras/b3a18d3f22288c5769cc0e70406972a2.webm?t=1787615500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867340/extras/b3a18d3f22288c5769cc0e70406972a2.mp4?t=1787615500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Generate stakeholder value:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create strategic partnerships with industry-leading brands to create shared service offerings in emerging markets, perform early customer feedback sessions and test out cutting-edge automated customer service agents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867340/extras/0ae4cc656fb8447da02137f42dbb534c.poster.avif?t=1787615500\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867340/extras/0ae4cc656fb8447da02137f42dbb534c.webm?t=1787615500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867340/extras/0ae4cc656fb8447da02137f42dbb534c.mp4?t=1787615500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gain prestige as you climb the corporate ladder:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While rivals try to sabotage you by ensuring you are only given the worst appointments imaginable, you must impress the C-suite with your stellar performance and go-getter attitude! Develop satisfying synergies with creative go-to-market strategies and you will be treated with recognition awards that you can leverage for growth opportunities. From there, develop professional competencies, get certified on the latest tech, and maybe even unlock a pizza party (or two)!!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867340/extras/8813e6fb1f2b00fd155b72adc6f28717.poster.avif?t=1787615500\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867340/extras/8813e6fb1f2b00fd155b72adc6f28717.webm?t=1787615500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867340/extras/8813e6fb1f2b00fd155b72adc6f28717.mp4?t=1787615500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867340/extras/7b945f086f047583c9cc6301570eff1a.poster.avif?t=1787615500\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867340/extras/7b945f086f047583c9cc6301570eff1a.webm?t=1787615500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867340/extras/7b945f086f047583c9cc6301570eff1a.mp4?t=1787615500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Meridian Wellness Group:</strong></h2>